<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fire Blast</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 150)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast fire blast &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast fire blast</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster slams a clenched fist into the other hand and screams 'Maelstra 
incerinata!', and a small blast sets the air alight in a ripple of flame 
that rolls away from the caster and strikes the target. It is the 
strongest of the fire spells: the better your magic and your fire sphere, 
the more it burns. It does best against clothes and less well against 
leather, chain and plate, and a shield softens it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
